[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18180.11, "timestamp": "05:03:00", "text": "赚5万块钱买下最后一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18183.948, "timestamp": "05:03:03", "text": "靠洗衣赚钱。那就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18186.788, "timestamp": "05:03:06", "text": "餐厅。这家餐厅就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18192.39, "timestamp": "05:03:12", "text": "你洗钱的金额大概是 8000 美元。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18197.59, "timestamp": "05:03:17", "text": "所以总共我们得到了8000个，其中2000个、4000个和6000个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18201.67, "timestamp": "05:03:21", "text": "总共应该是12个吧，对吗？6、7、8、9、10"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18207.99, "timestamp": "05:03:27", "text": "11 12 12 13 14 15 16 17 18 19 20 所以在一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18211.83, "timestamp": "05:03:31", "text": "洗钱2万块钱，然后还剩2万块钱的方法"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18219.67, "timestamp": "05:03:39", "text": "是的，那意味着我必须……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18220.91, "timestamp": "05:03:40", "text": "那"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18225.03, "timestamp": "05:03:45", "text": "从可卡因中提取大量毒品，然后全部倾倒出去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18231.51, "timestamp": "05:03:51", "text": "企业。接下来就是最大化最小值的问题了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18233.59, "timestamp": "05:03:53", "text": "包括储物空间等等。不，不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18238.59, "timestamp": "05:03:58", "text": "就像呃，填充所有这些"}]